              "value": "greia",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": ". These can be natural in speech and messages, but in formal writing you usually choose fuller and more neutral wording. The verb "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "skjønne",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
